<title>UK: UK manufacturing output on rising trend - Knight.</title>
<headline>UK manufacturing output on rising trend - Knight.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK Treasury minister Angela Knight said the underlying trend in manufacturing and industrial output was upwards.  </p>
<p>&quot;Monthly figures can be erratic,&quot; she said in a statement.</p>
<p>Knight said the prospects for manufacturing industry in 1997 were good.</p>
<p>DATA RELEASED TODAY SHOWED</p>
<p>--------------------------</p>
<p>UK NOV INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT +0.4% MM +1.3% YY, MANUFACTURING -0.5% MM +0.2% YY</p>
<p>UK MANUFACTURING OUTPUT +0.4% IN 3MTHS TO NOVEMBER VS PVS 3, +0.3% VS YR AGO</p>
